    "category.whyUse": "Why use {title}?",
    "category.whyUseDesc": "Every tool in this category works client-side, meaning your data never leaves your device. This makes them fast, private, and perfect for sensitive information. Whether you need a quick calculation, a file conversion, or a utility task, these browser-based tools deliver instant results without the overhead of installed software.",
