    "home.seoTitle": "Go LANA - Free Online Tools, Apps & Games",
    "home.seoDesc": "Go LANA offers 300+ free online tools for PDF, media, calculators, developer, business, education, health, and more. All tools run in your browser with no installation required.",
    "home.aboutTitle": "What is Go LANA?",
    "home.aboutP1": "Go LANA is a comprehensive library of free online tools designed to help you get everyday tasks done without installing software or creating accounts. With over 300 tools spanning PDF manipulation, media editing, financial calculators, developer utilities, business operations, education, health tracking, and browser games, Go LANA brings everything you need into a single, clean interface.",
    "home.aboutP2": "Every tool on Go LANA runs entirely in your web browser. This means there is nothing to download, no plugins to install, and no sign-up required. You open a tool, use it, and get your result — all within seconds. The tools work on desktop computers, laptops, tablets, and smartphones alike.",
    "home.privacyTitle": "Privacy by design",
    "home.privacyP1": "Because most tools process data locally in your browser, your files and information never leave your device. This is fundamentally different from server-based tools that require you to upload your data to a remote server. With Go LANA, you retain full control of your data at all times.",
    "home.privacyP2": "There are no accounts to create, no profiles to maintain, and no tracking of your tool usage. You simply visit the site, pick a tool, and use it. This makes Go LANA ideal for sensitive tasks like processing confidential documents, calculating personal finances, or generating secure passwords.",
    "home.benefitsTitle": "Benefits of browser-based tools",
    "home.benefit1": "No installation: Tools run instantly in any modern browser without downloads",
    "home.benefit2": "No registration: Use every tool anonymously with no account or login",
    "home.benefit3": "Privacy first: Most processing happens locally, so your data stays on your device",
    "home.benefit4": "Cross-platform: Works on Windows, Mac, Linux, iOS, and Android",
    "home.benefit5": "Always free: No hidden fees, no premium tiers, no trial limitations",
    "home.benefit6": "Fast: No server round-trips mean results appear instantly",
    "home.categoriesTitle": "Explore tool categories",
    "home.categoriesDesc": "Go LANA organizes its 300+ tools into intuitive categories so you can find exactly what you need. Browse PDF tools for merging, splitting, and converting documents. Use media tools to compress images, convert formats, and edit photos. Try calculators for mortgages, loans, and currency conversion. Explore developer tools for JSON formatting, regex testing, and code minification. Or dive into games, education tools, health trackers, and much more.",
    "home.featuredTitle": "Featured tools",
    "home.featuredDesc": "Some of the most popular tools on Go LANA include the PDF Merger for combining multiple documents, the Image Compressor for reducing file sizes, the QR Code Generator for creating custom codes, the Mortgage Calculator for estimating monthly payments, and the Password Generator for creating strong, secure passwords.",
    "home.faqTitle": "Frequently asked questions",
    "home.faq1Q": "Are Go LANA tools really free?",
    "home.faq1A": "Yes. Every tool on Go LANA is completely free to use with no hidden fees, premium tiers, or trial limitations. There are no accounts to create and no payment information required.",
    "home.faq2Q": "Do I need to install anything?",
    "home.faq2A": "No. All tools run directly in your web browser. There is nothing to download, install, or configure. Just visit the site, pick a tool, and start using it immediately.",
    "home.faq3Q": "Is my data safe?",
    "home.faq3A": "Most Go LANA tools process data locally in your browser, meaning your files and information never leave your device. This is more secure than server-based tools that require you to upload your data. Some tools may make network requests for specific features, which is noted on the tool page.",
    "home.faq4Q": "Do the tools work on mobile?",
    "home.faq4A": "Yes. All tools are responsive and work on smartphones, tablets, and desktop computers. The interface adapts to your screen size for optimal usability on any device.",
    "home.faq5Q": "How many tools does Go LANA have?",
    "home.faq5A": "Go LANA has over 300 tools across 14 categories, including PDF tools, media editors, calculators, developer utilities, games, education tools, health trackers, business tools, and more. New tools are added regularly.",
    "sitemap.title": "Sitemap - All Tools | Go LANA",
    "sitemap.seoDesc": "Browse every tool available on Go LANA, organized by category. Find free online tools for PDF, media, calculators, developer, business, education, and more.",
